    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "#Confirmation Message\n\nAn “Are you sure?” confirmation message appears when a website wants to double-check that you really want to do something, like delete a file or submit a form.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/10a35356def12590057b47080bbb55d9-Screenshot 2025-10-16 at 12.21.36 PM.png",
        "key": "computer-systems-lesson3-onlineresources-1-5c25ddab-c99a-4b94-8628-1e8d9bc30c38",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Timothy\n_Graphic Designer_\n\n> I like moving fast when I’m creating, but those “Are you sure?” pop-ups keep interrupting my flow. \n> I just want to get my ideas out without stopping every few seconds to confirm something!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b8ea07066b317bdcb386520417f28451-Screenshot 2025-10-16 at 12.34.07 PM.png",
        "key": "undefined-91f68b3a-8101-4f9c-861a-555ac85b7c47"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Martina\n_Retired Art Teacher_\n\n> I love creating my own digital art projects and sharing them with others. On a different site, I once deleted my work by accident—but here, I really appreciate that I always get an “Are you sure?” pop-up before anything is deleted!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2d214a703693dbbe3a6468172e31bb9b-Screenshot 2025-10-16 at 12.34.44 PM.png",
        "key": "ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-lesson1-level3b-test-2025-4ea4078e-bd1e-4e8b-9689-3877632820ff",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      }
    ],
    "display_name": "Confirmation Messages",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/917ca40deb1b2acf3cd3930f71d30d5d-Screenshot 2025-10-16 at 12.40.45 PM.png",
    "name_suffix": "_2025",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Hear from different users on their opinion of **confirmation messages**."
  },
